  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Page render with the section 'PrEP delivery in pharmacies', Box 11 'Evidence about PrEP delivery in pharmacies', and Box 12 'Oral PrEP initiation and continuation in private pharmacies in Kenya', which includes Fig. 4, a photograph of the SANAA PHARMACEUTICALS shopfront (photo credit: Fred Hutch/Katrina Ortblad).",
